BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sanjuro
DTSTART:20250729T010000Z
DTEND:20250729T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20250729T010000Z
UID:xPgsqtNoXE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective T
 oshiro Mifune swaggers and snarls to brilliant comic effect in Akira Kuros
 awa's tightly paced\, beautifully composed companion piece to Yojimbo. New
  4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-kurosaw
 a-retrospective/sanjuro
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yojimbo
DTSTART:20250729T033000Z
DTEND:20250729T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20250729T033000Z
UID:PqNBrQKcCM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 The incomparable Toshiro Mifune stars in this visually stunning and darkly
  comic genre-twister. New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs
 -and-events/akira-kurosawa-retrospective/yojimbo
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seven Samurai
DTSTART:20250730T020000Z
DTEND:20250730T055000Z
DTSTAMP:20250730T020000Z
UID:xi7Ea8rLiv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 207 mins (3h27m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 A 16th-century farming village requests protection from seven samurai agai
 nst a horde of bandits who have warned they will return when the crops are
  ripe. A gripping three-hour ride from master filmmaker Akira Kurosawa. 4
 K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-kurosawa-
 retrospective/seven-samurai
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Red Beard
DTSTART:20250731T020000Z
DTEND:20250731T052500Z
DTSTAMP:20250731T020000Z
UID:lpK3UQyu4v
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 185 mins (3h05m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 Perfectly capturing the look and feel of 19th-century Japan\, this testame
 nt to the goodness of humankind stars powerhouse Toshiro Mifune in his las
 t role for Kurosawa. New 2K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs
 -and-events/akira-kurosawa-retrospective/red-beard
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stray Dog
DTSTART:20250801T000000Z
DTEND:20250801T022500Z
DTSTAMP:20250801T000000Z
UID:AxHACflZ3O
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 122 mins (2h02m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 A bad day gets worse for young detective Murakami when a pickpocket steals
  his gun on a hot\, crowded bus. This early classic goes beyond a crime th
 riller\, probing the squalid world of postwar Japan and the nature of the 
 criminal mind. New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-ev
 ents/akira-kurosawa-retrospective/stray-dog
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Hidden Fortress
DTSTART:20250801T030000Z
DTEND:20250801T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20250801T030000Z
UID:HhPvuCVZOn
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 139 mins (2h19m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 Kurosawa’s first widescreen film is a delightfully comedic Samurai saga 
 starring Toshiro Mifune as a general charged with guarding his defeated cl
 an’s princess as the two smuggle royal treasure across hostile territory
 . New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-ku
 rosawa-retrospective/the-hidden-fortress
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
