 oshiro Mifune swaggers and snarls to brilliant comic effect in Akira Kuros
 awa's tightly paced\, beautifully composed companion piece to Yojimbo. New
  4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-kurosaw
 a-retrospective/sanjuro
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
